IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RECON.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 AMOUNT1 PIC 9(7).
01 AMOUNT2 PIC 9(7).
01 AMOUNT3 PIC 9(7).
01 EXPECTED PIC 9(7).
01 TOTAL PIC 9(7).
01 DIFFERENCE PIC 9(7).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ENTER FIRST AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT1

    DISPLAY "ENTER SECOND AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT2

    DISPLAY "ENTER THIRD AMOUNT:"
    ACCEPT AMOUNT3

    DISPLAY "ENTER EXPECTED TOTAL:"
    ACCEPT EXPECTED

    COMPUTE TOTAL =
        AMOUNT1 + AMOUNT2 + AMOUNT3

    DISPLAY "ACTUAL TOTAL: " TOTAL

    IF TOTAL = EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "MATCH"
    ELSE
        COMPUTE DIFFERENCE =
            TOTAL - EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "MISMATCH"
        DISPLAY "DIFFERENCE: " DIFFERENCE
    END-IF.

    STOP RUN.
